Package: fonts-vibeos-roboto
Architecture: all
Multi-Arch: foreign
Section: fonts
Conflicts: fonts-neo-roboto
Replaces: fonts-neo-roboto
Provides: fonts-neo-roboto
Depends: ${misc:Depends},
Description: Roboto variable font as Android ships it, for the VibeOS apps
 Roboto 3 as a variable font (weight 100-900, width 75-100), as Android
 ships it, under the family name "VibeOS Roboto" so that a static Roboto
 installed on the system never stands in for it. libvibeos draws the VibeOS
 apps' text with it.

