Recommends: vibeos-daemons,
Description: Calendar for VibeOS
 The LineageOS Etar calendar rebuilt in GTK 4 on evolution-data-server: day,
 month and agenda views, the event editor, and reminders that notify with the
 app closed (vibeos-calendar-reminders, a user service). With vibeos-wakeup
 (vibeos-daemons) a reminder wakes the phone from suspend.

