 The LineageOS DeskClock rebuilt in GTK 4: alarms, world clocks, timers, the
 stopwatch and the screen saver. Alarms and timers ring with the app closed
 (vibeos-clock-alarms, a user service). With vibeos-wakeup (vibeos-daemons) an
 alarm wakes the phone from suspend.

