Description: Phone app for VibeOS
 The LineageOS Dialer rebuilt in GTK 4: favorites, recents and contacts, the
 dialpad, the call log, blocked numbers, and the in-call and incoming-call
 screens. Calls go through ModemManager and callaudiod; contacts come from
 evolution-data-server. Calls ring with the app closed (vibeos-dialer-calls, a
 user service).

