Package: vibeos-dictate
Architecture: any
Breaks: neo-dictate (<< 1:0.1.0~)
Replaces: neo-dictate (<< 1:0.1.0~)
Depends: gstreamer1.0-plugins-base,
         ${shlibs:Depends},
         ${misc:Depends},
Recommends: vibeos-dictate-en | vibeos-dictate-de | vibeos-dictate-es | vibeos-dictate-fr | vibeos-dictate-it | vibeos-dictate-ru,
            gstreamer1.0-pulseaudio,
Suggests: vibeos-dictate-de,
          vibeos-dictate-en,
          vibeos-dictate-es,
          vibeos-dictate-fr,
          vibeos-dictate-it,
          vibeos-dictate-ru,
Description: dictation for VibeOS
 Dictate turns speech into text on the phone itself: a microphone button and a
 document, where what is said appears as it is said, with nothing sent
 anywhere. The document is plain text, edited and copied as any other. It
 hears English, German, Spanish, French, Italian and Russian, the language
 chosen in its app bar.
 .
 The recognisers are not part of VibeOS: vibeos-dictate loads Moonshine's
 (English, German, Spanish) and Vosk's (French, Italian, Russian) libraries
 from /usr/lib/vibeos-dictate and their models from
 /usr/share/vibeos-dictate/models. The packages vibeos-dictate-moonshine,
 vibeos-dictate-vosk and one per language (vibeos-dictate-en,
 vibeos-dictate-de, ...), made by tools/vibeos-dictate-speech in the source,
 install them.

